# Wilson Dyson Swarm

id:world-wilson-dyson-swarm a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Wilson Dyson Swarm" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/470030cd516a2> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- Fomalhaut Acquisition Society --------------------------------------\n\nA short roster for a reason: the Society is mostly shipborne, so its\npresence is largely not in places at all. Penglai, in the Shenjing system,\nis entered above under the Sophic League that mainly holds it." ;
    oa:kind "megastructure" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "The Wallace swarm's neighbour, 42 ly away in the article and 41.6 in the catalogue. Its distance from Beta Arae is given as 82 ly and the catalogue makes it 198; the difference is in Beta Arae's own distance, the direction agreeing to half a degree." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

